Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:08.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For years, obviously, your unfinished goal was to win a Grand Slam.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多年来 你的心愿是赢下大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:09.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Now that you've got two,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N如今你已拿到两座
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.96,0:00:14.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}does the goal, number one in the world, occupy that headspace?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第一会占据你的心思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:19.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Again, I think, yeah, it's definitely a talking point. There's no secret about it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这肯定是个话题 没什么好隐瞒的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:21.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's definitely a talking point for everybody at the moment.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在大家都在谈论它
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:25.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But for me, yeah, I'm motivated to keep playing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但对我来说 我有动力继续打下去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:28.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm motivated to keep fighting for good things, hopefully.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N继续为好结果拼下去 希望如此
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:32.36,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}6{\fs68}日 辛纳宣布结束赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:33.68,TL,,0,0,0,,今年的积分榜上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:35.65,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫领先{\fs78}800{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.65,0:00:38.12,TL,,0,0,0,,年终第一几乎到手 可他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:40.62,TL,,0,0,0,,还没当过一天世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:43.77,TL,,0,0,0,,可今年 他和阿尔卡拉斯 辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:46.73,TL,,0,0,0,,德约交手{\fs78}7{\fs68}次 一场没赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:50.26,TL,,0,0,0,,没赢过三强的年终第一 算数吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:53.92,TL,,0,0,0,,其中{\fs78}5{\fs68}场输给辛纳 包括温网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:56.24,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网半决赛输给阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:59.26,TL,,0,0,0,,北京{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛输给德约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.25,0:01:20.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A moment of brilliance from Carlos Alcaraz secures a place in his very first Australian Open final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯神来一笔 首进澳网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:34.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jannik Sinner seals his spot in a first Monte Carlo final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N辛纳锁定首个蒙特卡洛决赛席位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:37.62,TL,,0,0,0,,但这一年 不只有失利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:40.25,TL,,0,0,0,,法网决赛 他{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘击败科博利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.25,0:01:42.42,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到第一座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:38.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How about that! How about that!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了！太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.62,0:02:45.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sweet set-up, another forehand, crushed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮的铺垫 又一记正手 重重压下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:55.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Four sets of compelling tennis to finish up Wimbledon 2026.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N四盘扣人心弦 为{\fs78}2026{\fs68}温网收官
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:02:59.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A final to remember.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场值得铭记的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:15.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match, Zverev. Three sets to one: 6-3, 7-6, 5-7, 6-2.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 兹维列夫{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:19.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Zverev doesn't know he's won. He doesn't even know he's won.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫还不知道自己赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:22.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There you go.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这下知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:34.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He really didn't know. He was so focused in on just holding serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他真的不知道 一心只想保发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:40.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He didn't know he was at the finish line, and he finishes off Ben Shelton in four sets{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没意识到已到终点 四盘击败谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:47.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and wins his second major of the year, his first US Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下年度第二座大满贯 首个美网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:52.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We went 30 years without winning a Grand Slam title,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们{\fs78}30{\fs68}年没拿过大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.22,0:03:54.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and now we won two in a span of three months.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N如今三个月拿了两座
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:04:02.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think God has seen how hard we worked, how much we suffered, how much pain we went through,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N上天看见了我们的努力 煎熬和伤痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:08.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I think 2026 is the outcome of all the years that... that happened before, so...{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年是此前所有岁月的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:18.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's done it again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他又一次做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:21.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:26.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There's something about this place,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这座球场有种特别的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.07,0:04:31.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and there is something about this man.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个男人也有特别之处
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:35.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The unbeaten record here in Beijing continues.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他在北京的不败纪录仍在延续
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:37.82,TL,,0,0,0,,答案在规则里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:39.29,TL,,0,0,0,,排名每周一更新
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:41.06,TL,,0,0,0,,只算最近{\fs78}52{\fs68}周
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:44.50,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季结束时排第一 就是年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:47.05,TL,,0,0,0,,积分只看打到第几轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:48.99,TL,,0,0,0,,大满贯冠军{\fs78}2000{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:51.10,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是谁并不影响
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:52.76,TL,,0,0,0,,他今年两座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:54.66,TL,,0,0,0,,就是{\fs78}4000{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:56.64,TL,,0,0,0,,这套电脑排名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:59.42,TL,,0,0,0,,始于{\fs78}1973{\fs68}年{\fs78}8{\fs68}月{\fs78}23{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:02.58,TL,,0,0,0,,第一位世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68} 是纳斯塔塞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:08.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a very, very exclusive club, being number one in the world,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第一是极少数人的俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:14.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I think it's the ultimate goal we have, you know, 52 weeks of consistent tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N终极目标 {\fs78}52{\fs68}周稳定的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:17.90,TL,,0,0,0,,可年终第一 并不总是年度最佳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.76,TL,,0,0,0,,一九七五到七八年 {\fs78}1982{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:24.60,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1989{\fs68}年 两个称号都不是同一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:28.15,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1977{\fs68}年 维拉斯拿下法网和美网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.15,0:05:30.68,TL,,0,0,0,,美网决赛击败康纳斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:33.14,TL,,0,0,0,,可按当年的平均分算法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:35.57,TL,,0,0,0,,年终第一仍是康纳斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:39.36,TL,,0,0,0,,七四到七八年 他连续{\fs78}5{\fs68}年年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:45.41,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1989{\fs68}年 贝克尔拿下温网和美网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:48.22,TL,,0,0,0,,两次击败伦德尔 当选年度最佳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:50.77,TL,,0,0,0,,年终第一仍是伦德尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:54.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No way.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:58.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Match point. Becker has it all to do.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛点 贝克尔必须全力挽救
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't believe it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:10.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, this will surely be remembered as the match and the tiebreak that had everything.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场比赛和抢七注定被铭记
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.17,0:06:14.04,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}2000{\fs68}年起 年度最佳球员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:16.19,TL,,0,0,0,,每年都是年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:19.71,TL,,0,0,0,,年终第一 有时要拼到最后一站
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.62,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年总决赛决赛 穆雷对德约
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:25.39,TL,,0,0,0,,谁赢 谁就是年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:34.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Murray wins!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N穆雷赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.99,0:06:41.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Murray wins it all!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N穆雷包揽一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:50.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's champion of the Barclays ATP World Tour Finals,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他是{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}年终总决赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:53.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and he's created history{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他创造了历史
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:59.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}by becoming only the 17th player in the history of the game{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N成为史上第{\fs78}17{\fs68}位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:05.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to be crowned year-end world No. 1.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N加冕年终世界第一的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:16.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, it's obviously the crown of the season, you know, finishing the year as number one in the world.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以世界第一结束赛季 是一季的王冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:17.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think it's a dream of every tennis player.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是每个网球运动员的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:22.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's one of the most difficult things to do in our sport.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是这项运动里最难做到的事之一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:28.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Obviously, you know, winning Grand Slams and being number one in the world are probably the pinnacles of the sport.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大满贯和世界第一是运动巅峰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:31.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But you win two majors in a season,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一个赛季赢两座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:36.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it's hard not to be picked as the man of the year,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很难不当选年度最佳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I think if you asked any of the players,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N如果问任何一位球员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.99,0:07:42.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}they'd probably pick majors over world number one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多半会选大满贯而非世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:43.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and he might actually be able to do both.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而他也许能两样都拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:44.97,TL,,0,0,0,,两座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.97,0:07:47.51,TL,,0,0,0,,加上几乎到手的年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.51,0:07:50.55,TL,,0,0,0,,明年 他能赢下三强吗？
